alse,"text":"どこか醒めたような、それでいて内に激しさを秘めたＧ０９突撃前衛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつてはアリシャと同じく、難民キャンプに身を寄せていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23989","sourceWorkId":"32480","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エチオピア出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みのりと同様に士官学校出身の特殊戦技兵。煙草を嗜む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこか醒めたような、それでいて内に激しさを秘めたG09突撃前衛。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつてはアリシャと同じく、難民キャンプに身を寄せていた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"108812"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79b101a27ad4800a4dcb945d425aab7b3c85e00ec1f2fef8c8301ba365e64317.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47e245dc576d8491aa81b972a60e3e3f9522e502cc50c046476c223bcfb0015f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杏 蜜姫","creatorId":"vndb:s26410","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26410","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26410","name":"杏 蜜姫","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:90335","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c105887","characterName":"アリシャ・オラオン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"108813","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"367589"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23988"],"vndbCharacterId":"c105887"},"originalCharacterName":"アリシャ・オラオン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A fiery Indian Special Warfare Trooper who is part of G02 with Abigail Clark and Lin Wanchen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having lived in refugee camps ever since she was young, she voluntarily came to the Cathedral in order to escape her hellish living circumstances."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When she's around men, she often acts seductively towards them and invites them to play with her body, especially after battles."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c105887"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"燃えるような赤毛と褐色の肌を持つ、インド出身の特殊戦技兵。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アビゲイル・クラーク、林万姫と共にＧ０２を構成する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から難民キャンプで暮らし、その地獄から逃れるためカテドラル行きを志願。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自ら男性士官たちにその肉体を開き、昇天させる堕天使のように振舞っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23988","sourceWorkId":"32480","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"燃えるような赤毛と褐色の肌を持つ、インド出身の特殊戦技兵。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アビゲイル・クラーク、林万姫と共にＧ０２を構成する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から難民キャンプで暮らし、その地獄から逃れるためカテドラル行きを志願。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自ら男性士官たちにその肉体を開き、昇天させる堕天使のように振舞っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"108813"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/829c6355488e23aa1ef1f7ac569d2298997b5e936d935028d8ae86fe5fae48c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d71a88b6925be4ebb3e0413d895cc3b3abc9a4349d43cd1eb2cdbc594cdd431.webp","width":219,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小澤みのり","creatorId":"vndb:s15910","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s15910","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s15910","name":"小澤 みのり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:367589:108813:32659:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c93492","characterName":"リゼット・オージュロー","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92441","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"316212"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22872"],"vndbCharacterId":"c93492"},"originalCharacterName":"リゼット・オージュロー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lisette became the first Special Warfare Trooper during the initial C.C. invasion, leading mankind to its first victory against the aliens’ attack on Mars. Mankind views her as their hero, who saved them right as they teetered on the brink of despair."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is currently stationed on the Cathedral where she continues to fight, but for some reason the other Special Warfare Troopers rarely see her..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93492"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｃ．Ｃの初侵攻時、最初の特殊戦技兵となり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"火星近傍で地球側初の戦果をあげ、さらに月軌道会戦では人類勝利の立役者となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まさに人類を滅亡の縁から救った英雄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在もカテドラルにおいて戦果を上げ続けているが他の特殊戦技兵たちにその姿を見せることはほとんどない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22872","sourceWorkId":"30069","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ＬＣＣ探偵社の所長にしてヒーロー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相手の話に全く聞く耳をもたない理不尽力と、人質の存在など全く気にしない決断力を持つ名探偵（自称）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カレーを作るのも食べるのも好き。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22872","sourceWorkId":"32480","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"C.Cの初侵攻時、最初の特殊戦技兵となり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"火星近傍で地球側初の戦果をあげ、さらに月軌道会戦では人類勝利の立役者となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まさに人類を滅亡の縁から救った英雄。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在もカテドラルにおいて戦果を上げ続けているが"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他の特殊戦技兵たちにその姿を見せることはほとんどない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92441"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71dccb0f6634295197768010e6a5e1005aed2b41c6c974dfd949e86f47e297e3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/cac6920662b06a5b8ac5fad4840db3159e56741a9b2e4509426dcef118a8f693.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:367589:92441:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c93493","characterName":"キルケ・ベルンハルト","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92442","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"316212"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22871"],"vndbCharacterId":"c93493"},"originalCharacterName":"キルケ・ベルンハルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she was once a magical girl, she now serves as a communications operator on the Cathedral instead. She was part of Lisette's team during the first C.C. invasion up through the Lunar Orbit Battle. In the events of that battle, her powers were crippled."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she still retains some weak long-distance telepathy powers, which is why the military allows her to continue serving on the Cathedral. She is the only woman on the base that isn't an actively serving Special Warfare Trooper. As a result, she also functions as a counselor of sorts to Minori and the other Special Warfare Troopers."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93493"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元魔法少女。現カテドラル通信オペレーター"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｃ．Ｃの初侵攻時、リゼットとコンビを組み月軌道会戦で活躍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがその最中に特殊戦技の能力を喪う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"僅かに残った長距離テレパス能力を買われ、カテドラルの通信オペレーターとして軍に留まっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特殊戦技兵を除くカテドラル唯一の女性として、みのりたちのカウンセラー的な役割も担っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22871","sourceWorkId":"30069","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ＬＣＣ探偵社の秘書にしてメイド担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勤務時間内も勤務時間外もコンビニとスーパーで働き、貧乏探偵社を支える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その能力はそんじょそこらのアルバイトに匹敵し、レジ打ちの腕前はまさに普通。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"リゼットの言うことに肯定しかしない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22871","sourceWorkId":"32480","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元魔法少女。現カテドラル通信オペレーター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"C.Cの初侵攻時、リゼットとコンビを組み月軌道会戦で活躍。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがその最中に特殊戦技の能力を喪う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"僅かに残った長距離テレパス能力を買われ、カテドラルの通信オペレーターとして軍に留まっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特殊戦技兵を除くカテドラル唯一の女性として、みのりたちのカウンセラー的な役割も担っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92442"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c3/c38f736db2b3eab32d8fa7c62b65659089daf6db72c0bf704bdbc8b6cee5b1d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d9236e6072d25eea06d8bf5315f725aa6c603f044507c1e55340281535f7f0d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桐村まり","creatorId":"vndb:s1549","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1549","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1549","name":"桐村 まり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:367589:92442:23768:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c93494","characterName":"レイ・ツァンチェン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"92443","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"316212"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22873"],"vndbCharacterId":"c93494"},"originalCharacterName":"レイ・ツァンチェン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"28"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Li Canxue is another former magical girl who formed a trio with Lisette and Circe during the initial C.C. invasion. Her feats during the Lunar Orbit Battle were second only to Lisette herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She continued fighting the C.C. after the Lunar Orbit Battle, but was killed in the line of duty three years after the Cathedral's founding."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c93494"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元魔法少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｃ．Ｃ初侵攻時、リゼット、キルケとトリオを組み、月軌道会戦でリゼットに次ぐ活躍を見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後もＣ．Ｃとの戦いの最前線に立ち続けていたが、カテドラル創設３年目に殉職。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22873","sourceWorkId":"30069","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ＬＣＣ探偵社の副所長にして家賃担当。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"浮気調査からペット探しまで地道な仕事を一手に引き受ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その能力はプロ級で、ドラマの探偵に勝るとも劣らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怒りのアイアンクローはリゼットをも唸らせる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22873","sourceWorkId":"32480","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元魔法少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"C.C初侵攻時、リゼット、キルケとトリオを組み、月軌道会戦でリゼットに次ぐ活躍を見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後もC.Cとの戦いの最前線に立ち続けていたが、カテドラル創設3年目に殉職。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"92443"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f614e4d176f82f098128d264def4057f62b0a8351c0bf29af85e337cbf50e97.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4093eed539eca2491d884f77a8f19d6f2be01ad1b2a20f53ba5ac55416d4aa1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:367589:92443:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"charact